{"id": "official:sentence:6c1a6729-0ab6-4812-94d8-5268d6c237fa", "text": "有时我真的不知道他在想什么。", "shortMeaning": "有时我真猜不出他心里想啥。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23b62442-9845-45a8-b60d-41c93ba3cfd1", "text": "有时这些照片不是很好。", "shortMeaning": "这些照片有时拍得不怎么样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43b1129f-5ad0-4ce4-aab9-2b8bf6850b9b", "text": "有是有的，不过远了一点。", "shortMeaning": "有倒是有，就是远了点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d7c6ef2-0fa5-48f2-b40c-30556c0108b4", "text": "有有我之境，有无我之境。", "shortMeaning": "境界里有“有我”之境，也有“无我”之境。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff377445-8d84-4759-a2d6-4f414da5ecf5", "text": "有朋自远方来，不亦乐乎？", "shortMeaning": "朋友从远处来，不也让人高兴吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:499570a1-8542-423d-81be-b136cf1aa473", "text": "有条小路穿过农田。", "shortMeaning": "一条窄路从田里穿过去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
